Bug fixed. The issue was on line 7 — `b.url === inc.url` does an exact string comparison, so URLs differing only in hostname case (e.g. `example.com` vs `EXAMPLE.com`) were treated as different bookmarks.

Changed to `b.url.toLowerCase() === inc.url.toLowerCase()` so hostname comparison is case-insensitive, matching how URLs are normalized per RFC 3986 (hostnames are case-insensitive).


